  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" alt=\"關於標題\"></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8djzQBruLto\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@nightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnightbeam.gitbook.io%252fremnants%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=文件&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=read-the-docs&amp;logoColor=white\"></a></p>\n</div><p style=\"font-size:1.1em;line-height:1.6\">誕生於地底深處的<strong>殘遺者</strong>，結合了不死族的韌性與古代戰鬥大師的致命精準。無論您是經驗豐富的冒險者，還是尋找下一場大戰的刺激追求者，這個模組都能帶給您心跳加速的體驗。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上贊助我\" width=\"240\"> </a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" alt=\"功能介紹\"></p><h2><strong>殘遺鬼影</strong>&nbsp;</h2><p>一名神秘的骷髏忍者，以速度、欺騙與致命精準掌控戰場。</p><h3>能力</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>影衝鋒：</strong>&nbsp;高速衝刺攻擊，能貫穿玩家。</li>\n<li><strong>苦無彈幕：</strong>&nbsp;投擲旋轉的苦無投射物，附有自訂飛行動畫。</li>\n<li><strong>瞬移突襲：</strong>&nbsp;短暫消失後出現在毫無防備的玩家背後。</li>\n<li><strong>相位轉換模式：</strong>&nbsp;盛怒時獲得新的攻擊模式與提升的速度。</li>\n</ul><h3>戰鬥體驗</h3><ul>\n<li>非常適合地下城競技場或後期遊戲進度。</li>\n<li>包含<strong>自訂紋理、模型、動畫與音效</strong>（衝刺、攻擊、主題音樂）。</li>\n</ul><h2><strong>骷髏僕從</strong></h2><p>鬼影身旁有亡靈僕從在戰鬥中協助他。</p><h3>戰鬥角色</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>近戰骷髏戰士：</strong>&nbsp;以高速移動衝向攻擊者。</li>\n<li><strong>守衛僕從：</strong>&nbsp;在頭目脆弱階段保護他。</li>\n<li><strong>波次召喚：</strong>&nbsp;根據頭目生命值門檻召喚額外僕從。</li>\n</ul><h2><strong>變異老鼠</strong></h2><p>在廢墟、洞穴與地下城中穿梭，甚至在頭目戰前就增添危險。</p><h3>變體</h3><ul>\n<li>普通老鼠、灰色老鼠、黃色老鼠、藍色老鼠</li>\n</ul><div>\n<h2>支援與連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>文件：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnightbeam.gitbook.io%252fremnants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://nightbeam.gitbook.io/remnants</a></li>\n<li>Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK</a></li>\n<li>GitHub：<a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MeherBenSalem</a></li>\n<li>CurseForge：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects</a></li>\n<li>Modrinth：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您發現錯誤或想要新功能，請開啟問題或到 Discord 留言。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>\n</div>",
